# One spell effect opacity slider (client/BASE.md 0049, MANIFEST.md "game_effectopacity"): Options > Effects keeps the base's opacityEffects slider as the only one, labelled "Spell effects opacity", 25-100% (boss warning circles never vanish); its apply clamps and sets the alpha of every effect source. The four per-source sliders (Options > Effects own / other players / creatures / boss area, and the same four in the HP/MP circle options) are removed: on 10.98 every effect is drawn with the own alpha, so they fought over it. Lua and OTUI only. The overlay module game_effectopacity migrates old saved values once.
